        <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11000' id='25' type-v2='text' w='30788' x='2364' y='2960'>
          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f40000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Objective of the report</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Tracking the number of new customers on NFV and measuring:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>1. How effectively are we retaining these customers (Reorder Rate)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>2. Customer&apos;s performance (Frequency &amp; ABV)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#f40000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Definitions</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Cohort Size:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>The number of new customers In each month (New on NFV chains)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Filtered Cohort Size:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>The number of new customers coming from the filtered vertical/chain/store</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Reorder Rate:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>% of new customers acquired who order the following month / months</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Frequency:</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>AVG number of orders that each customer place in a month</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>ABV (Average Basket Value):</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>The average value of each order (Total Sales / Total Orders)</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8' underline='true'>Spend / Customer:</run>
            <run bold='true' fontcolor='#000000' fontsize='8'>Æ </run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
